<title>USA: USDA PL-480 pact with Suriname for wheat, veg oil.</title>
<headline>USDA PL-480 pact with Suriname for wheat, veg oil.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department Thursday said a PL480 sales pact was signed with Suriname for the purchase of $2.5 million worth of U.S. wheat and $2.5 million worth of edible vegetable oil.</p>
<p>USDA said the action will provide financing for the purchase of about 5,000 tonnes of vegetable oil and 13,000 tonnes of wheat.</p>
<p>The supply period is fiscal 1997.</p>
</text>
